          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "gardeshgar is a native compound of gardesh 'an outing', built on gashtan 'to turn, to wander', and the ending -gar 'doer'."
